  "question": {
    "text": "Upon treatment with ammoniacal&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>H</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mtext>S</mtext> </mrow> </math>, the metal ion that precipitates as a sulphide is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mtext>Fe</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>III</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mtext>Al</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>III</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mtext>Mg</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>II</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mtext>Zn</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>II</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math>",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Among Fe<sup>3+</sup>, Al<sup>3+</sup>, Mg<sup>2+</sup> and Zn<sup>2+</sup>, only Zn<sup>2+</sup> is precipitated with ammoniacal H<sub>2</sub>S as ZnS.</p><p>The group III metal ions, in presence of NH<sub>4</sub>OH when H<sub>2</sub>S is bubbled through filtrate Ni<sup>2</sup><sup>+</sup>, Co<sup>2</sup><sup>+</sup> and Zn<sup>2</sup><sup>+</sup> are precipitated as sulphides.</p>"
  }
